    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Lynam Auctioneers are delighted to introduce No 33 Ballinteer Crescent to the market. This charming and spacious family home is located in a quiet residential estate, in the heart of Ballinteer.\r\n\r\nExtending to approximately 117m2, this home has been lovingly maintained and upgraded and boasts a separate attic room.\r\nAccommodation is generous throughout  and filled with natural light due the excellent east/west orientation of the property. \r\n\r\nAccommodation comprises a welcoming entrance hall opening to a spacious living room. The kitchen and dining area is  located off the living room and designed in an open plan style. With sleek cabinetry and a kitchen peninsula, this is an ideal space for entertaining or a growing family. On the first floor there are 3 well appointed bedrooms and a family bathroom. \r\n\r\nAccommodation is completed by a most useful attic space, ideal for user as an office or play room. \r\n\r\nThe very large west facing garden is flooded with light and offers fantastic potential for further extending the property, subject to planning permission. The garden is laid in lawn with a workshop to the rear. \r\n\r\nNo. 33 Ballinteer Crescent is located very close to Dundrum Shopping Centre, offering an array of amenities including shops, cafes, restaurants and a cinema. The area is also well served by a host of fantastic schools including Wesley College, St Columba's College, Our Lady's Grove and Holy Cross Dundrum to name a few. There is also a great selection of sporting and leisure facilities nearby including Meadowbrook Leisure Centre and swimming pool and Marley Park.\r\n\r\nEarly viewing advised"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance hall: c. 4.57m x 1.90m\r\n\r\nLiving room: c. 4.15m x 3.75m\r\n\r\nKitchen/dining room: c. 3.82m max x 5.75m\r\n\r\nLanding: c. 3.09m x 1.91m\r\n\r\nBedroom 1: c. 4.15m x 3.07m\r\n\r\nBedroom 2: c. 3.82m x 3.74m\r\n\r\nBedroom 3: c. 2.55m x 2.58m\r\n\r\nBathroom: c. 2.23m x 1.91m\r\n\r\nAttic landing: c. 1.59m x 1.13m\r\n\r\nAttic room: c. 4.08m x 2.51m\r\n\r\nOffice: c. 2.39m x 2.07m\r\n\r\n\r\nDisclaimer: Whilst every attempt has been made to ensure the accuracy of the floor plan contained here, measurements of doors, windows, rooms and any other item are approximate and no responsibility is taken for any error, omission, or misstatement. This plan is for illustrative purposes only and should only be used as such by any prospective purchaser."
      },
